# Domain reverted: urbanstore.co.ke -> campusmart.co.ke (back to the
# original domain). 301 (permanent) preserves whatever search ranking/link
# equity was earned during the brief Urban Store period instead of losing
# it to duplicate-content/404s. Keep these rules (and keep urbanstore.co.ke
# attached as a custom domain on this Cloudflare Pages project) until
# Google Search Console's Change of Address has fully propagated back —
# don't remove this block early.
https://urbanstore.co.ke/* https://campusmart.co.ke/:splat 301!
https://www.urbanstore.co.ke/* https://campusmart.co.ke/:splat 301!
https://www.campusmart.co.ke/* https://campusmart.co.ke/:splat 301!

# Redirect admin routes from main domain to admin subdomain
https://campusmart.co.ke/admin/* https://admin.campusmart.co.ke/admin/:splat 301!
https://admin.urbanstore.co.ke/admin/* https://admin.campusmart.co.ke/admin/:splat 301!
https://*.pages.dev/admin/* https://admin.campusmart.co.ke/admin/:splat 301!

# Allow admin routes only on admin subdomain
/admin/* /admin/:splat 200
